        "title": "Electrical Grid - Energy Storage",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Capital cost: $1,500–3,000/kW installed (new build), $100–200/kWh energy capacity\nAsset life: 50–100 years (civil/hydro infrastructure; electrical equipment replaced)\nO&M: ~$15–25/kW/year (relatively low; mostly equipment maintenance)\nRound-trip efficiency: 80–90%"
    },
