        "title": "Electrical Grid - Energy Storage",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Li-ion has captured essentially all new grid storage builds since ~2018. The reasons:\n- Costs have fallen 97% since 2010 (from ~$1,200/kWh to $130-200/kWh in 2024)\n- Fast response: milliseconds vs minutes for thermal plants\n- Modular: build any size from 100 kWh to 10+ GWh\n- High round-trip efficiency: 85-92%\n- Known technology from EV industry — supply chains, manufacturing, performance models well-developed"
    }
